      <p class=3D"txt">U-CAN is a national network connecting urban practit=
ioners, government officials, researchers and philanthropies working to bui=
ld more liveable cities across India. Since launching, the network has brou=
ght together 500+ practitioners, 200+ government officials and 25+ cities t=
o share what works and act on it together. Here's how U-CAN turns individua=
l effort into collective action, and what it's helped build so far.</p>
